#: ../../../developer/releases/4_2/release-notes.rst:70
#: 3e6a3df2480e49659dd72a9f4ab3e3a6
msgid ""
"DomU firewalls have completely switched to nftables. Users should add their "
"custom rules to the ``custom-input`` and ``custom-forward`` chains. (For "
"more information, see issues `#5031 <https://github.com/QubesOS/qubes-issues/"
"issues/5031>`__ and `#6062 <https://github.com/QubesOS/qubes-issues/"
"issues/6062>`__.)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/releases/4_2/release-notes.rst:72
#: 8c82107a83aa4c5da2ea76175129cbe8
msgid ""
"Templates restored in 4.2 from a pre-4.2 backup continue to target their "
"original Qubes OS release repos. If you are using fresh templates on a clean "
"4.2 installation, or if you performed an :ref:`in-place upgrade from 4.1 to "
"4.2 <user/downloading-installing-upgrading/upgrade/4_2:in-place upgrade>`, "
"then this does not affect you. (For more information, see issue `#8701 "
"<https://github.com/QubesOS/qubes-issues/issues/8701>`__.)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/releases/4_2/release-notes.rst:76
#: 8d490946a16e4045933f612454192610
msgid ""
